; This export set intentionally differs from the traditional DBI.
; This binary is only ever loaded by cDAC-aware dbgshim that's collocated, which resolves exactly
; two DBI entrypoints on it: OpenVirtualProcessImpl2 (out-of-proc / data-target activation)
; and CoreCLRCreateCordbObject3 (in-proc creation).
; All other exports that tried to do COM/Windows emulation are dropped so the module can have a private PAL.

; In-proc creation path from the shim
CoreCLRCreateCordbObject3

; Out-of-proc creation path from the shim - ICLRDebugging
OpenVirtualProcessImpl2
